#
# Keycloak Client 配置步骤：
# 1. 创建 Realm → de-platform (或自定义名称)
# 2. 创建 Client：
#    - Client ID: de-platform
#    - Client Type: OpenID Connect
#    - Client authentication: OFF (public client, 用于 PKCE)
#    - Standard flow: ON
#    - Direct access grants: ON (用于密码登录模式)
# 3. 设置 Valid Redirect URIs:
#    - http://localhost:3000/auth/callback (开发)
#    - https://your-domain.com/auth/callback (生产)
# 4. 设置 Valid Post Logout Redirect URIs:
#    - http://localhost:3000/login (开发)
#    - https://your-domain.com/login (生产)
# 5. 设置 Web Origins:
#    - http://localhost:3000 (开发)
#    - https://your-domain.com (生产)
# 6. 在 Realm Settings → Login 中按需开启用户注册